k:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_2c1d25-e7 img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_2c1d25-e7[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_2c1d25-e7\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}</style>\n<h6 class=\"kt-adv-heading4922_2c1d25-e7\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_2c1d25-e7\">When will the court session be held?</h6>\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2\"]{font-style:normal;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2 mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2 img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}</style>\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_febbb0-f2\">The Roselle Municipal Court session will be held every Thursday at 9:00 am.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n<style>.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col,.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;}.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col > .aligncenter{width:100%;}.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{opacity:0.3;}.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b{position:relative;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}}</style>\n<div class=\"kadence-column4922_2aa782-4b inner-column-2\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea\"]{font-style:normal;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}</style>\n<h6 class=\"kt-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_601d58-ea\">Can I apply for bail against fines, cost and waiver of right if I do not appear on my schedule at the court?</h6>\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9\"]{font-style:normal;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9 mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9 img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}</style>\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_12c640-b9\">Yes, you can apply for bail against fines, cost and waiver of rights if you do not appear on my schedule at the court by sending an authorization form to the court.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n</div></div>\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);padding-top:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);padding-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}</style><div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id4922_5a84cf-95 alignnone\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top\">\n<style>.kadence-column4922_f15b22-a3 > .kt-inside-inner-col,.kadence-column4922_f15b22-a3 > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column4922_f15b22-a3 > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.