g4922_a76aa4-14[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14 img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}</style>\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading4922_a76aa4-14\">If you do not pay the fine on time, an additional fine will be added to the previous fine, and your license or insurance will be suspended.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n</div></div>",
